    "race_handling_disclosure": "Per the 2013 ACC/AHA Guideline (Goff et al., Circulation 2014;129:S49-S73, Section 4.1), because sex- and race-specific pooled cohort models were derived exclusively for Non-Hispanic African American and Non-Hispanic White cohorts, the guideline explicitly specifies using the Non-Hispanic White equations for individuals of other racial and ethnic backgrounds (e.g., Hispanic, Asian American, American Indian, multiracial). Risk estimates may under- or over-estimate risk in these populations."
